  <h2>Quality is Our Foundation</h2>
  <p>Many buyers worry that "stock" means "lower quality." At Fitclo, our <strong>ready-to-ship activewear</strong> is produced on the same high-tech lines as our largest custom orders, ensuring premium quality every time.</p>
  
  <h3>Built-In Quality Assurance</h3>
  <p>Because we own the 50,000㎡ manufacturing facilities, we control every step of the stock production. We don't buy surplus; we intentionally manufacture stock to the highest global standards.</p>
  
  <h3>Our Quality Commitment</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Fabric Testing:</strong> Every roll of fabric is tested for colorfastness, shrinkage, and stretch recovery before knitting.</li>
    <li><strong>100% Final Inspection:</strong> Every garment in our stock inventory undergoes a final manual inspection before it is shelved.</li>
    <li><strong>Certified Excellence:</strong> Our stock production is fully BSCI and OEKO-TEX compliant.</li>
  </ul>

  <p>When you buy stock from Fitclo, you are buying the same world-class quality that the world's leading fitness brands depend on.</p>
